column7:
There are a series of measures taken, such as:
- SGG has requested the institutions under the scope of the regulation to designate stewards for the implementation (partially appointed);
- SGG has started working groups with the appointed stewards to work on the mapping of datasets and identify the measured needed for implementation (cadastre, meteorological, statistics etc.);
- the appointed stewards are kept updated on implementation and monitoring news from EU level;
- the SGG has participated in the high-level meetings of the Inspire Implementation National Council to inform and foster on the additional measures required for HVDs Regulation in relation to INSPIRE;
- some of the institutions under the scope of the Regulation have initiated impact studies and procedures for the implementation (National Meteorological Authority; National Cadastre Agency);
