Open Government Week: https://data.gov.ro/blog/rezumatul-intalnirii-prima-strategie-nationala-privind-datele-deschise;
https://data.gov.ro/blog/saptamana-guvernarii-deschise-un-univers-de-date-utile-ins (information session with students on open data and statistical data);
Regular meetings on geo-spatial Data: https://geo-spatial.org/proiecte/seminarii/cluj2024/
